        },
        {
          "text": " Kosodi Daudi aboŋokin kotema Akimelek Ekitit, ka Abisai okoku loka Seruia, onaee loka Yoab, ebe, “Iŋai kiupar keoŋ oidukurun neejai Saul? “Kobala Abisai ebe, “Kiupar eoŋ kaio.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.26.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.26.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 26:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwaŋin kopotu Daudi ka Abisai neejaas ituŋa kuare: ido koany, aperi Saul koiotoi kokidin kagalin, kodupakina akekwara kwap kakouke: koperete Abiner ka ituŋa alukunite ŋes, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.26.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.26.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 26:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1SA.24.18"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Sam 24:18",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Kosodi Abisai atemar Daudi atiar, “Kiiaik Edeke lokasurupikon akanikon lolo: aso keŋainait koeamakinai keeum ŋes kakwara aipelor kiton alup aieumet adiopet, mam erueakini aicum ŋes nakiareit.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.26.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.26.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 26:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kotema Daudi Abisal atiar, “Sirikiar ŋes: naarai iŋai eriori akekan aluikin loinyonyoikinit EJAKAIT akinyet, komam egwaun akirot?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.26.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.26.9"
            ]
          }
        },
