        },
        {
          "text": " Kotema Daudi atiar, “Kwape ejaria EJAKAIT, inomi EJAKAIT ŋes; diat edoluni apaaran naka atwanareke; elemuni kolot ojie, koarakinai nina, ",
          "type": "text",
