        },
        {
          "text": " Madi akuj eoŋ arior akakan aluikin loinyonyoikinit EJAKAIT akinyet: konye, kenainait, kolem akwara naejai akouke, ka etuo loka akipi, kaloto.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
