              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kiworo Daudi ituŋa, ka Abiner okoku loka Ner ebe, “Abiner, mam jo ibonokinir “Kosodi Abiner aboŋokin ebe, “Iŋai ijo loiworot ekabaka?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.26.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
