        {
          "text": " Kojen Saul eporoto loka Daudi, kotema atiar, “Erai ŋol ekoniporoto, okokuka Daudi?” Kotema Daudi atiar, “Eebo, ekaiakait, wu ekabaka, ŋes ekaporoto.” ",
