            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Aso do, kinyeis akaokot abukokinio akwap naemamei EJAKAIT: naarai alomu ekabaka loka Isirael amoot idepidepit, kwape emejaa ituŋanan atapen koronan.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
